  "description": "Designed for Nissan Frontier 2005-2026, this durable, double-layer PVC tonneau cover offers full protection for your 5ft truck bed. Easy to install with no drilling, it shields against dust, water, and UV rays while providing convenient full bed access.\nFeatures\nPerfect Fit for Nissan Frontier 2005-2026 (Not for Mexico)\nThis soft Tri-fold tonneau cover is specifically engineered for Nissan Frontier models from 2005-2024, ensuring a flawless fit for your 5ft truck bed. It enhances your vehicle's functionality and overall look, making it an essential accessory for those seeking both style and practicality.\nDurable Double-Layer PVC Material for Maximum Protection\nCrafted from premium double-layer PVC, this tonneau cover offers superior durability and longevity. The heavy-duty construction is designed to withstand harsh weather conditions, ensuring that your truck bed remains protected from water, dust, UV rays, and other environmental elements.\nComplete Bed Protection from Water, Dust, and UV Rays\nThis tonneau cover offers comprehensive protection for your truck bed and cargo. It effectively seals out rain, dust, and harmful UV rays, keeping your belongings secure and in pristine condition. Whether you're driving through rain or intense sunlight, your truck bed is fully safeguarded.\nTension Latch System for Easy Access and Security\nEquipped with a state-of-the-art Tension Latch System at the tail end, this Tri-fold cover makes it easy to lock and unlock the truck bed. The design ensures that you can access your bed quickly while keeping your cargo secure when the cover is closed, offering convenience without compromising security.\nHassle-Free, No-Drill Installation with Included Tools\nThe tonneau cover can be installed without any need for drilling or modification to your vehicle. All necessary tools and detailed instructions are included, allowing for a quick and straightforward installation process. Enjoy enhanced truck bed protection in just a few simple steps.\n1 Year warranty service, Professional installation is highly appreciated recommended.\nFitment\nCompatible with 2005-2026 Nissan Frontier Fleetside 5ft Bed.\nFor Models w/ Utili-Track System onnly\nNOT FOR México Ver.",
